variety including synths.\n✓  detailed lore found as \"intel\" throughout the game offering more immersion into the Alien universe for fans.\n✓  a good amount of customisation for character including perks, weapons and weapon mods.\n✓  you can make a number of class and weapon presets. Depending on the mission or who makes up your team you can make saved variations of class perk boards and weapons equipped with particular mods instead of constantly changing them before a mission.\n\nCons\n✖  matchmaking can be a while to find others but still a good amount of online player presence, depending on the time of day.\n✖  can get repetitive, but, if your someone who likes to play around with customisation and challenging themselves with increasing difficulty than it might not be so bad.\n✖  A very basic story, but, it is a game centred around combat so not surprising.\n✖  would of liked to have seen more options for gun mods, and perk board customisation.\n\nAll in all, a solid Aliens game that achieves what it set out to do.", "timestamp_created": 1743994741, "timestamp_updated": 1743994741, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.511494219303131104", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192099820", "author": {"steamid": "76561198865256438", "personaname": "Legonich", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198865256438/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 788, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 513, "last_played": 1771725670, "avatar": "9f05e7ee3c0defd15a61b14dac56d2d9fe1e6c05"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game is super fun, it take a bit to get settled in but the story is super cool and cant wait to get the DLC", "timestamp_created": 1743907109